# Frontend (macOS SwiftUI + TCA) — Overview

## Structure (Domain-based)

- **Cohesion**: Related functionality grouped by business domain
- **Separation**: Clear boundaries between domains
- **Dependencies**: Core infrastructure provides shared services
- **Scalability**: Easy to add new domains (e.g., AI/Search, Settings, etc.)

## Backend bootstrap from app

- **Swift-dotenv approach**: Environment variables loaded from `.env.{dev|prod}` (repo root 또는 번들 리소스)
- **Implementation**:
  - Env 로딩 및 캡슐화: [Environment.swift](mdc:apps/macos/Voyager/VoyagerHelper/Infrastructure/Environment.swift)
  - 프로세스 스폰: [ProcessRunner.swift](mdc:apps/macos/Voyager/VoyagerHelper/Infrastructure/ProcessRunner.swift)
    - `Environment` 의존성 주입으로 설정 관리
    - `BackendProcessConfig` 구조체로 프로세스 설정 캡슐화
- **Environment keys**:
  - `PUBLIC_BACKEND_HOST`, `PUBLIC_BACKEND_PORT`
  - `PUBLIC_BACKEND_PROCESS_NAME` (bundled 모드에서 바이너리 파일명)
  - `BACKEND_MODE` (Xcode Run 시, `source|bundled`)
- **Backend execution modes**:
  - **Debug builds (source)**: Uses local `uv` to launch backend (`uv run dev|prod`)
    - Python 프로세스에 전달되는 환경 변수: `APP_ENV`, `BACKEND_MODE`, `PATH` (homebrew 경로 포함)
  - **Bundled mode**: Uses bundled Nuitka binary from app resources
    - Binary path: `{bundle.resourceURL}/server/{PUBLIC_BACKEND_PROCESS_NAME}`
    - Built via [scripts/build/build-backend-binary.sh](mdc:scripts/build/build-backend-binary.sh)
    - Self-contained app bundle without requiring local `uv` installation
    - Python 프로세스에 전달되는 환경 변수: `APP_ENV`, `BACKEND_MODE`
- **Python dotenv loading**: Python 백엔드의 `load_config()`가 `APP_ENV`를 기반으로 `.env.{app_env}` 파일을 자체적으로 로드하므로, Swift에서 모든 dotenv 값을 주입할 필요 없음

## Notes

- Prefer deriving API base from `{PUBLIC_BACKEND_HOST}:{assignedPort}` (port는 런타임에 동적 할당될 수 있음).
- Ensure helper launches backend before issuing API calls.
- See [12-frontend-http-client-guidelines.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/10-macos-voyager/12-frontend-http-client-guidelines.mdc) for HTTP client patterns.
